title: Konrad Adenauer
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, labor
card-image: img/portraits/adenauer.jpg
view-if: adenauer_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Konrad Adenauer

Adenauer is the popular Mayor of Cologne and president of the Prussian State Council. He's one of the most staunch supporters of "leaving the tower" - opening of the party to Protestants.

- @interconfessionalism
- @interconfessionalism_support
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@interconfessionalism
title: Building an Interconfessional Party
subtitle: Can we expand our party to all Christians?
view-if: interconfessionalism = 0
choose-if: interconfessionalism_support >= 2 and advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][?if interconfessionalism_support < 2: There is not enough support for this policy within the party.?]
go-to: interconfessionalism

@interconfessionalism_support
title: Building Support for Interconfessionalism
subtitle: Adenauer has been one of the strongest proponents of "Leaving the tower".
view-if: interconfessionalism = 0
on-arrival: interconfessionalism_support += 1; labor_strength += 5; left_strength += 5;

Within our party, we are pushing forward proposals for Interconfessionalism against the Center faction.

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Adenauer" and president != "Adenauer" : Adenauer must be Chancellor or President. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Adenauer" or president == "Adenauer")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
